    {
      "sort": 300000,
      "name": "Episode",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "2742sBM1d9CfiQVX",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>To carry on the general framing of our campaign structure the system refers to a session as an <em>episode</em>, with a defined beginning, middle and end, with procedures to go along with it all.</p><p>The intent is to provide directors with a structure they can follow from session to session and players with anticipation for some of the procedures these contain.</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
