    {
      "sort": 400000,
      "name": "Opening",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "UV3w7Ebpvp6pEWcC",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>After both you and your players are ready to begin play, we go on with the <em>opening</em> procedure. It not only includes some things you are familiar with (such as recounting the events of the last session) but a few more, all in a more formalized way.</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
