    {
      "sort": 500000,
      "name": "Credits",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "MwHfaT4ls684Fy0Q",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>At the end of each episode the director will run the following procedure to tally which experience triggers were met during the session. These consist not only of the default list below but also those from among each of the heroes' classes.</p><p>Every episode the party gains 10 XP (worth one level) by default, and can earn up to 10 more through meeting the various experience triggers.</p><p>This is meant to incentivize the players to play to the fictions of their characters and to the ideals of the genre.</p><h2>Experience Triggers</h2><p>The following is the default list of experience triggers.</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>A needless battle was avoided.</p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>A dangerous foe was defeated.</p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>A guest was recruited.</p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
      },
